<title>POLAND: Animex Q4 net falls to PLN 3.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Animex Q4 net falls to PLN 3.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Animex SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 5.50 vs    1.39 loss</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   6.48 vs   26.45</p>
